reviews.text_strengths:
Relevant problem of standardising reports;
Thorough comparison with state-of-the-art LLMs;
Ablation study.

reviews.text_weaknesses:
Even though the checkpoints are shared, there is a need to provide more instructions on:
a) how to run the models;
b) provide test data as examples;
c) provide evaluation scripts for reproducing the Table 1 results.
Evaluation by domain experts is missing, it would be great to include human evaluation;
The domain is very specific, a few experiments on other reports outside ophthalmology.
How large is the test set?

